; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhSRdkTVQkR5xTUFH28vGdnFalVpvcOu2KbliwaKxpGgMU27WB14jowI78TFYHHpI5DAZ2dGigvWpfRsLFMLpf4WtU8YCrgz7e61bP0qngu2Ax5ltJlKpp0QA6rmN3HUe-7ZaJAdQuSqnBPArb6fVE6dv1n0XbSrgg2JxNK1tfcYIEZTH3NO6lNgCACmMhB\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhSRdkTVQkR5xTUFH28vGdnFalVpvcOu2KbliwaKxpGgMU27WB14jowI78TFYHHpI5DAZ2dGigvWpfRsLFMLpf4WtU8YCrgz7e61bP0qngu2Ax5ltJlKpp0QA6rmN3HUe-7ZaJAdQuSqnBPArb6fVE6dv1n0XbSrgg2JxNK1tfcYIEZTH3NO6lNgCACmMhB\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiv8YB_wsgt14z6hFXjfW4Gn13lq-hlwhNCPRxrptY6ZJGt6SpBlBh8zp4uVuCKthA9n54JxqnCNiNKw51Q5-PAKvE57ksge86Pc-X_RI9_JnhcPWpMMges3gudim8B3zNkwfuck_zA4si7rVghb5Ckyf4_wmyFh46on8Z0QNkhf4o3DZgz-mmk_kjnadxP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3038\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiv8YB_wsgt14z6hFXjfW4Gn13lq-hlwhNCPRxrptY6ZJGt6SpBlBh8zp4uVuCKthA9n54JxqnCNiNKw51Q5-PAKvE57ksge86Pc-X_RI9_JnhcPWpMMges3gudim8B3zNkwfuck_zA4si7rVghb5Ckyf4_wmyFh46on8Z0QNkhf4o3DZgz-mmk_kjnadxP=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">人食到40歲，事業已經到一个坎站，應該是上風sia̍k-sia̍k ê時tsūn，事業已經tsiūnn-kioh有成就，厝內囡仔mā大漢--ah，生活應該是「食清，睏宮，人精英」，不而過現實ê生活，kánn-ná m̄是án-ne。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">國中畢業30幾年，suah kah國中同學lóng無聯絡，逐擺聽著阿母、阿兄iah是朋友講beh去參加同窗會，tsiânn欣羨--neh！尤其是kah三个阿兄，平平是讀仝一个學校，趣味--ê是阮同學ê阿姊iah是阿兄kah三兄iah是二兄仝班。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">看in歡歡喜喜去參加同窗會，阮tsit班suah無消無息。後--來是阮tsit屆有一个同學，伊可能真思念國中同學，就堅心去逢甲揣同學，kā in hit班真濟同學lóng招來開同窗會。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阮以早國中國小ê同學，大部份lóng熟sāi，所致in hit班同窗會開煞，阮tsit班劉教授mā開始講beh揣同學，張護理師真熱心，開始google逐家ê名。有一工我收著一張電子批，講伊是我ê同學，就án-ne我hông揣--著，阮tsit幾个同學有ê khà電話，有ê走去幾个同學國中時代蹛ê厝，去問in阿母同學ê消息。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阮hit站仔綿tsinn綿爛揣人，一睏仔就揣著30幾个同學，逐家lóng真hònn玄，以早ê同學tsit-má過了按怎，逐工上班tńg厝，lóng leh看手機仔tī LINE講天講地，講hāu-hia，講飯lē。以早好笑ê趣味代，lóng想--起-來--ah！逐工看手機仔leh笑bi-bi，m̄知ê人叫是leh kah愛人仔聯絡--leh！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">歡頭喜面喙仔li̍h-sai-sai ê日子無過偌久，suah開始感覺目睭ta-ta koh澀澀。Tann害--ah，逐工上課kah做khang-khuè lóng ài用電腦kah手機仔，目睭tiam-tiam tsiânn痛苦，忍--幾-工就擋bē tiâu--ah，姑不而將請翁婿載我去看目睭，原來是ta目症，就m̄敢koh逐暗食飽煞就leh開講話仙、拍lā涼--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Suà--落-來是我leh用電腦ê時tsūn lóng ē慣勢khiau跤，年久月深suah感覺龍骨怪怪，giâu疑是龍骨歪tshua̍h。驚kah緊走去病院幾若tsuā了後，醫生講無hiah-nī仔嚴重，不而過mā kā我平常時做代誌ē khiau跤ê歹習慣改掉--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">人若衰，種匏仔生菜瓜。早起精神ê時tsūn，ē感覺我ê手蹄仔怪怪，本來無掛意，有一工早時仔，suah感覺手蹄仔無法度彎khiau。查電腦tsiah知影家己mā leh tuè時行，就是人講--ê用電腦kah手機仔siunn久，手蹄仔ē得--著ê病症『板機指』，所致sńg手機仔ê時tsūn，就khah有站節，m̄敢kah以早仝款，sńg siunn久--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">今年歇熱ê時tsūn，學校真濟所在lóng leh做工程，雖bóng逐家lóng講少囝化，學生愈來愈少，阮ê學校一年仔suah ke一班。Tsit學期我ê教室mā改做學生囡仔ê教室，開始ài走班，因為有歲--ah，走班了後，tńg厝就忝kah ē khoo雞bē pûn火--ah，逐擺lóng siàng大眠。睏醒beh起--來，suah感覺行路跤後tenn lóng tsiânn疼，跤底ê筋膜發炎，所致tsit-má穿鞋仔ài揣有氣墊ê鞋仔，tńg厝tsiah bē koh行路huah疼。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit-má tsiah體會以早人講ê「tsiūnn卌bē攝」，真有道理。心內mā bē親像以早hiah-nī仔無肝無kiān，食一把膽，ài開始調養身體--looh！做代誌tio̍h-ài khah有站節，bē-sái因為急性就tshóng-tshóng-pōng-pōng，人講「緊行無好步」，lán勻勻仔來就好。</span></div></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ=w448-h640\" width=\"448\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-co